{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;The King of Go&gt; is an innovative turn-based Go game. You can use your pieces to block the key points of your opponents and kill them. You can enter the store to obtain various relics to enhance yourself. In addition, you can also participate in online battles, enjoy duels with online players, and earn points and skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game function</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Combining Go with Roguelike will make the game more interesting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. More special effects and animations were used</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting a difficulty curve in the game of Go can promote better growth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The visualization of battles enables players to experience the feeling of a decisive battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048820/extras/fa40bb200c77031d5e869a5061b8e168.poster.avif?t=1764337065\" width=546 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048820/extras/fa40bb200c77031d5e869a5061b8e168.webm?t=1764337065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048820/extras/fa40bb200c77031d5e869a5061b8e168.mp4?t=1764337065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048820?t=1764337065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048820/fd7e815da72d09f05d28dc33493f8593821d869f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764337065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048820/31909599f547432a9636e44ffcbe91ef5dc752ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764337065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048820